    <h2>Level 27 walkthrough: every move in order<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 1</span>
      <strong>Steps 1–3: Drag the steel wool on the bed to the bald prisoner</strong>
